{"id":"mdn-0d2516510a0f7ece","html":"<p>Type spécifie la langue de la feuille de style pour cette feuille de style.</p>\n<h2>Syntaxe</h2>\n<pre><code>string = stylesheet.type;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Exemple</h2>\n<pre><code>stylesheet.type = &quot;text/css&quot;;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Spécification</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/2000/REC-DOM-Level-2-Style-20001113/stylesheets.html#StyleSheets-StyleSheet-type\">type</a></p>\n","attribution":"MDN Web Docs et ses contributeurs","sourceUrl":"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/StyleSheet/type","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","changes":"Mise en forme pour Nunya ; macros interactives et images distantes omises. Le texte n’a pas été aligné au programme togolais.","resource":{"id":"mdn-0d2516510a0f7ece","title":"StyleSheet.type","s":"tech","t":"api","p":"mdn","f":"article","c":"API & technologies du web","u":"","d":60,"l":"reference","v":"","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/fr/docs/Web/API/StyleSheet/type","b":311},"related":[{"id":"mdn-341549c5aaf620d4","title":"StyleSheet.title","f":"article"},{"id":"mdn-a27d22d960b5fd8d","title":"StyleSheetList","f":"article"},{"id":"mdn-2ef8abf04576a0cb","title":"SubtleCrypto.digest()","f":"article"}]}